sangati displacement

  "krama-phala kshetra-sthita"
  "kshetrajna-yukta kaala-yukta"
  "viveka-yukta direction-yukta"
  "domain-physics-sthita"

  -- kramanusara chain: displacement is the root quantity
  -- velocity is kramanusara of displacement wrt time (d displacement / d time)
  "velocity-kramanusara-phala"

  -- matra: displacement is measured in metres.
  -- this is the ROOT unit — velocity, acceleration, jerk units
  -- all derive from here via kramanusara (each d/dt subtracts T^-1).
  "metre-matra"

  -- avastha: displacement can have initial/final states
  "avastha-sthita"

done
